rer contract requires button controls and a linear equivalent."},{"campaign_id":"rcamp_6BTV1N60C6HCB6PG01M1V85P0D","claim_class":"assumption","created_at":"2026-09-06T11:38:01.669Z","goal_id":"goal_EWE2CVDFA4XAF44G01M1V85P0D","id":"rclm_AEFK9BBJE07K2NG901M1V85P05","text":"human_study_n=0 and comparative_human_effectiveness=NOT_MEASURED; S1-013 limits (no population human data, no independent raters, raw deleted) are inherited; same-host replay is not external audit."},{"campaign_id":"rcamp_6BTV1N60C6HCB6PG01M1V85P0D","claim_class":"fact","created_at":"2026-09-06T11:38:01.669Z","goal_id":"goal_EWE2CVDFA4XAF44G01M1V85P0D","id":"rclm_CBMFASJ0KC5NVF5201M1V85P05","text":"Provenance and independence cues follow S1-011 knowledge-gate statuses and S1-012 independence groups verbatim; the renderer never changes status, policy or authority (renderer_may_change_authority=false)."},{"campaign_id":"rcamp_6BTV1N60C6HCB6PG01M1V85P0D","claim_class":"fact","created_at":"2026-09-06T11:38:01.666Z","goal_id":"goal_EWE2CVDFA4XAF44G01M1V85P0D","id":"rclm_FRCESY2XAD2P764A01M1V85P05","text":"Both CARD and GRAPH render from one canonical dispute contract; machine parity checks report identical claims, evidence, statuses, sources, independence groups, relations, wording and answer choices for all 8 tasks with a symmetric one-action disclosure rule."},{"campaign_id":"rcamp_6BTV1N60C6HCB6PG01M1V85P0D","claim_class":"fact","created_at":"2026-09-06T11:38:01.668Z","goal_id":"goal_EWE2CVDFA4XAF44G01M1V85P0D","id":"rclm_GD86T660A27XB20Y01M1V85P05","text":"A real Chromium keyboard-only run completes practice plus 8 counterbalanced trials, opens every disclosure without a pointer, exports a versioned envelope that the strict importer accepts, and rejects a forged contract binding."},{"campaign_id":"rcamp_6BTV1N60C6HCB6PG01M1V85P0D","claim_class":"fact","created_at":"2026-09-06T11:38:01.668Z","goal_id":"goal_EWE2CVDFA4XAF44G01M1V85P0D","id":"rclm_KXSVBB9619NA5FE301M1V85P05","text":"Deterministic technical replay across two separate processes reproduces identical observation and metric digests; per-variant/per-task counts keep missing, timeout and withdrawn trials in the denominator."},{"campaign_id":"rcamp_6BTV1N60C6HCB6PG01M1V85P0D","claim_class":"inference","created_at":"2026-09-06T11:38:01.668Z","goal_id":"goal_EWE2CVDFA4XAF44G01M1V85P0D","id":"rclm_N8WQWF1KJMGHC5C601M1V85P05","text":"Following the overview-then-details pattern and the node-link versus alternative-representation precedent, level-0 must show claim, status, challenge, source/origin and independence group in both variants; representation advantage is expected to be task dependent, not universal."},{"campaign_id":"rcamp_6BTV1N60C6HCB6PG01M1V85P0D","claim_class":"inference","created_at":"2026-09-06T11:38:01.669Z","goal_id":"goal_EWE2CVDFA4XAF44G01M1V85P0D","id":"rclm_YX1VSA7R1KBCTHBZ01M1V85P05","text":"Operator design review (n=1) approved provisional CARD_WITH_GRAPH_DRILLDOWN under frozen decision rule; this is a design-contract approval, not a human-effectiveness result."}],"current_chain_hash":"2dbdc8535840d58809940568208a465fac9dd863819bad34be1fcf558e50296b","evaluations":[{"artifact_chain_hash":"2dbdc8535840d58809940568208a465fac9dd863819bad34be1fcf558e50296b","campaign_id":"rcamp_6BTV1N60C6HCB6PG01M1V85P0D","created_at":"2026-09-06T11:38:01.710Z","details":{"audit":{"auditor":"agentos-s1-014-independent-verifier","limitations":["ticket status PASS_WITH_LIMITS; audit verdict covers preparation evidence only, never human effectiveness","human_study_n=0; comparative_human_effectiveness=NOT_MEASURED","single operator acts as owner and reviewer (design approval only)","same-host process-separated replay, not external audit","external HCI sources stored as bibliographic/availability records, not full text","inherited S1-011/S1-012/S1-013 limits carried verbatim in dependency-gate.json"],"producer":"agentos-s1-014-producer","subject_producer":"agentos-s1-014-producer","verdict":"pass_with_limits"},